{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2016-common-biology-01","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2016,"subject":"biology","number":1,"points":1.5,"unitId":"micro","unitLabel":"미생물·바이러스","topic":"세균·대장균·미생물","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["micro","gene","cell","ecology"],"stem":"그림은 미생물 A∼C의 세포막과 세포벽 구조를 나타낸 것이다. \nA∼C는 각각 대장균, 메탄생성균, 효모 중 하나이다.\nA\nB\nC\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n[1.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 남세균은 A와 같은 세포벽을 갖는다.\nㄴ. B는 대장균이다.\nㄷ. rRNA 유전자의 염기서열에 기초한 계통수에서 A와 B의 \n유연관계는 A와 C의 유연관계보다 가깝다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":468,"height":144,"region":0,"bbox":[56.3,49.303,187.2,57.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-common-biology-01/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":525,"height":260,"region":0,"bbox":[43.9,124.903,210.0,104.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-common-biology-01/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":462,"height":266,"region":0,"bbox":[56.3,248.903,184.8,106.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-common-biology-01/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":776,"height":236,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,428.503,310.4,94.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-common-biology-01/04.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":2,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.297,417.0,706.342],"width":334.1,"height":554.045,"items":[{"type":"image","ass